<http://example.org/kg/link/ng_2012__osberghaus_2012_rapid_equilibrium_sma> rdfs:label "Ng 2012 ~ Osberghaus 2012 (rapid equilibrium SMA)" ;
    mkg:linkDescription "Ng 2012 and Osberghaus 2012 (rapid equilibrium SMA) are mechanistic models of protein chromatography that represent column transport and protein binding to predict separation behavior. Ng 2012 models human IgG capture on a protein A adsorbent, using pH-modified Langmuir binding and a lumped mass-transfer description to optimize batch productivity. Osberghaus 2012 (rapid equilibrium SMA) models strong cation-exchange chromatography of three proteins, using steric mass action to represent competition with salt and protein shielding, and compares methods for estimating its binding parameters. Thus, they address the same unit operation but differ in adsorbent, binding mechanism, model structure, and primary purpose." ;
